in one or two throws, then the unicorn teleported.
Does the thrown gem have to have been discovered in order to gain luck?

Whatever luck I gained didn't help me against &s (demons).
I didn't have wand of cancellation, and even though I had good strength,
weapons, and armor on level 23, they eventually pummeled me.
