I've come to the conclusion that the best monster to test wands on is
a floating eye. About the worst thing to do to a monster is turn him
invisible. But this led to finally finding a positive use for this wand -
if you can't see the eye, you can't be frozen by its gaze. Stomp.

Love the new #dip command for avoiding poison potions. And it's a
double bonus because whatever weapon you dip gets enchanted +1.

